video_middle:
Next, he shows his preparation work to achieve this trick:
- He first pours the soda into a measuring cup;
- He then cuts the top portion of the bottle with a soldering iron to create a hole;
- He blows up a balloon;
- After that, he sticks the edge of the balloon through the hole and proceeds to glue it tightly to ensure the air remains trapped;
- Once the modifications are completed, the man empties the container so there is only the balloon filled with air and places it inside the bottle.
